- [England](https://morningrows.com/england.json)
- [Scotland](https://morningrows.com/scotland.json)
- [Wales](https://morningrows.com/wales.json)
- [Northern Ireland](https://morningrows.com/northern-ireland.json)
- [United States](https://morningrows.com/united-states.json)

Australia's /morning.json alias remains available. Search and agent retrieval are allowed; training crawler restrictions remain in robots.txt.
